@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@csrf = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_GET_CSRF
@roomId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@studentId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@buildingId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@residenceId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@receiptId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@accountId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@actorKind = STUDENT

# Dữ liệu giả; nhập ID seed thực tế. REST client cần lưu cookie.
## GETcsrf -> login -> GETcsrf mới -> gọi role đã đăng nhập.

### getCsrfToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "STUDENT",
  "identifier": "SV001",
  "password": "DemoOnly#2026"
}

### logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### changePassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "DemoOnly#2026",
  "newPassword": "ChangedDemo#2026"
}

### getCurrentIdentity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### studentGetProfile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/profile
Accept: application/json

### studentUpdateContact
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/profile
Accept: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+84900000000",
  "email": "sv.demo@example.test"
}

